[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 240.07, "timestamp": "00:04:00", "text": "我們完成了為期兩個月的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 244.309, "timestamp": "00:04:04", "text": "生酮週期。現在已經是第三個月了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 247.229, "timestamp": "00:04:07", "text": "我們只剩下最後一個月了。這個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 251.83, "timestamp": "00:04:11", "text": "月有很多事情要做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 254.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:04:14", "text": "因為我要去日本，所以有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 258.59, "timestamp": "00:04:18", "text": "很多事情要處理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 262.87, "timestamp": "00:04:22", "text": "所以從某種意義上來說，這個月是最後一個月，有點像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 267.43, "timestamp": "00:04:27", "text": "這個月和下個月的最後衝刺階段。是的。  呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 269.95, "timestamp": "00:04:29", "text": "下個月上半月。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 272.71, "timestamp": "00:04:32", "text": "所以，儘管因為其他事情的緣故，我沒能做很多想做的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 275.99, "timestamp": "00:04:35", "text": "事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 279.35, "timestamp": "00:04:39", "text": "等等，但能和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 284.909, "timestamp": "00:04:44", "text": "你們每個人一起度過這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 288.629, "timestamp": "00:04:48", "text": "兩個月，哪怕是24小時，仍然非常開心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 290.31, "timestamp": "00:04:50", "text": "雖然我大部分時間都在睡覺，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 293.11, "timestamp": "00:04:53", "text": "過去一段時間，Wicks一直都在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 294.83, "timestamp": "00:04:54", "text": "這裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 296.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:04:56", "text": "等等，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 299.43, "timestamp": "00:04:59", "text": "我仍然非常感謝"}]